# P3 (wave 2 steps 4-6): do npcs farther than 60 m (AiFar2) and 30-60 m (AiFar) from the hero walk where
# they are sent? Vino goes to NW_FARM1_PATH_01; bench.log "where ..." every 5 s, with ai=.
